---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro'; import InquiryCTA from '../components/InquiryCTA.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="About Us | BallValve"><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><Breadcrumb current="About Us" /><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT BALLVALVE</p><h1 class="title">Confidence for<br /><em>industrial flow.</em></h1><p>Since 2004, we have focused on the engineering and manufacture of ball valves for industrial customers worldwide.</p></div></section><section class="section container prose"><h2>Focus is a long-term commitment</h2><p>BallValve believes a great valve is not simply a component. It is part of a system that must run reliably. We continue to develop material, sealing, manufacturing, and application expertise to turn complex requirements into clear solutions.</p><h2>Company Overview</h2><div class="company-video"><video controls preload="metadata" playsinline><source src={`${base}videos/v11.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />Your browser does not support HTML5 video.</video></div><h2>Collaboration without borders</h2><p>We work openly with customers, engineering companies, and channel partners, supporting every project with clear technical communication, consistent quality, and responsive delivery service.</p></section><InquiryCTA /></BaseLayout>
